        "FeedEntryContent": "<a href=\"http://lh5.ggpht.com/-LciSIpF9xzI/UehQrVDzaWI/AAAAAAAAAJU/-5SJy9B33cA/%252520Aktifkan%252520button%252520subscribe%252520di%252520Facebook_img_1.png\"><img src=\"http://lh5.ggpht.com/-LciSIpF9xzI/UehQrVDzaWI/AAAAAAAAAJU/-5SJy9B33cA/%252520Aktifkan%252520button%252520subscribe%252520di%252520Facebook_img_1.png\" style=\"margin: 0pt 10px 10px 0pt; float: left cursor: pointer;\" height=\"150px\" width=\"112px\" /></a><br><br><br><br /><b>Assalamualaikum </b>.<br /><br>Hai guys ! Lama ta jumpe kan :P<br /><br>Haha . Adat lah . SPM candidate lah katakan :P<br><br />Ha kali ni aku nak ajar cara hilangkan button Add Friend kat profile facebook korang tu .<br /><br>Contohnya macam ni<br><br /><br>ha , nak tahu kan cemane buat dea ?<br><br />Jum teruskan :)<br /><br>1 . Aktifkan subscriber<br><br />Setting - subscriber - tick kat enable blabla<br /><br>2 . Privacy setting ( blah kanan atas )<br><br />Who can send you friend request ?<br><br />Tukar everyone kepada friend by friend .<br /><br>Done :)<br><br />Tak susah pun kan .<br><br />Yang penad menaip guna hp :P<br><br />Assalamualaikum<br />",
